Natural Earth 1:50m cultural/physical vectors
================================================================================
Source:    https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/
License:   Public domain
Bundled:   Yes — the 1:50m land layer is vendored as
           tools/naturalearth/ne_50m_land.geojson.gz and converted at build
           time (:core's convertNaturalEarth task) into natural-earth.bin on
           the desktop target's resource path, for the event map (§14.1).
           The Android artifact does not carry it.
Notes:     Courtesy credit: "Made with Natural Earth."

